1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,710
Waves come in two kinds, sorted by how the particles move.

2
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:12,135
In a transverse wave, they vibrate at right angles to the direction the wave travels, forming crests and troughs.

3
00:00:12,135 --> 00:00:17,968
A wave on a string, a ripple on water, and light are all transverse.

